cff-version: 1.2.0
title: >-
  A Python replication of Yeh & Hsu (2018), "Building real estate valuation
  models with comparative approach through case-based reasoning"
message: Please cite the original article; this repository is a replication.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/Skecon/qca-real-estate-replication
abstract: >-
  An end-to-end replication of the Quantitative Comparative Approach of Yeh and
  Hsu (2018) on the Sindian circle of the UCI Real Estate Valuation data set,
  with the paper's hedonic benchmarks, repeated-split significance testing, and
  an exhaustive test of the decomposition sequence the authors listed as future
  work.
keywords:
  - real estate valuation
  - case-based reasoning
  - hedonic price model
  - replication
references:
  - type: article
    title: >-
      Building real estate valuation models with comparative approach through
      case-based reasoning
    authors:
      - family-names: Yeh
        given-names: I-Cheng
      - family-names: Hsu
        given-names: Tzu-Kuang
    journal: Applied Soft Computing
    volume: 65
    start: 260
    end: 271
    year: 2018
    doi: 10.1016/j.asoc.2018.01.029
